\opensection{Text and translation}

\textandtranslation

\noindent Acts 12:11; Psalm 138 (139):1–2. The verse is given as in the
\la{Graduale Romanum}. Medieval Polish graduals end it at \la{sessionem
meam}; singers who prefer that reading apply the termination to
\la{ses-si-ó-nem me-am}.

